OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan lacks community
OL,4,Afacilities, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major new housing development that
OL,7,Fcould transform the landscape south of
OL,8,FCambridge has been met with opposition
OL,9,Ffrom a parish council.
OL,11,FPlans for Cambridge South, a proposed
OL,12,Fdevelopment of 4,000 homes alongside a
OL,13,Fnew country park with direct access to
OL,14,FCambridge South station and the Guided
OL,15,FBusway, have been unveiled to residents
OL,16,Fin Great Shelford.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
