OL,3,GNEWSAHomes plan lacks community
OL,4,Afacilities, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers, Pigeon and Lands
OL,7,FImprovement, said half of the homes
OL,8,Fwould be affordable housing and the
OL,9,Fscheme would help meet demand from
OL,10,Fworkers at the Cambridge Biomedical
OL,11,FCampus (CBC).
OL,13,FBut Great Shelford Parish Council has
OL,14,Fhighlighted concerns about lack of
OL,15,Fcommunity facilities and said that "the
OL,16,Fsite does not provide what is needed".
